title: Infoblox: Update deferrals
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports the maintenance windows configured in the tenant, which govern
 when Infoblox applies software updates to NIOS-X servers.

 The service is always {OK}. When no windows are configured it states so
 explicitly, since that means updates are applied automatically whenever
 Infoblox chooses, which is worth knowing when reading version history.

discovery:
 One service is created on the tenant host.
